{"track":"r","category":"함수·재귀","level":3,"title":"피보나치 (재귀)","desc":"<p><code>fib_rec(n)</code>은 n번째 피보나치 수를 <b>재귀</b>로 구합니다. <code>fib_rec(0)=0</code>, <code>fib_rec(1)=1</code> (n은 20 이하).</p>","solution":"fib_rec <- function(n) {\n  if (n < 2) {\n    return(n)\n  }\n  fib_rec(n - 1) + fib_rec(n - 2)\n}\n","hint":"<p>f(n) = f(n−1) + f(n−2), 시작 f(0)=0, f(1)=1.</p>","tests":[{"call":"fib_rec(0)","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"fib_rec(1)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"fib_rec(10)","expected":55,"visible":false},{"call":"fib_rec(15)","expected":610,"visible":false},{"call":"fib_rec(20)","expected":6765,"visible":false}],"starter":"fib_rec <- function(n) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-348"}